<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Function Notation — expanding f(a+h)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Let \( f(x) = {@p@}x^2 + {@q@}x + {@r@} \), where \(a\) and \(h\) are any two real numbers.</p>
<p>Find and fully expand \( f(a+h) \).</p>
<div>\( f(a+h) = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</div>
<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Substitute \(x=(a+h)\) into <strong>every</strong> occurrence of \(x\) in \(f(x)\), then expand:</p>
\[ f(a+h) = {@p@}(a+h)^2+{@q@}(a+h)+{@r@} = {@ta@}. \]
<p>Note that \(f(a+h) \neq f(a)+f(h)\) in general &#8212; a function does not "distribute" over addition unless it happens to be linear with no constant term.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2026063000</text>
